{
  "about": "The components of a binary release and their licenses (research r1-release-plan section 4.2). A native_sources entry that ends with /* covers only the files directly in its folder. tools/release_check.py reads this file: 'docs' writes NOTICE.txt and licenses/<id>.txt, and 'stage' checks that each DLL and exe of the release, each NuGet package and each copyright holder in the shipped sources has a component. A text source is 'repo:<path in the clone>', 'header:<source file>' (its first comment block), 'nuget:<package id>/<file>' (the version comes from the deps.json files) or 'runtimepack:<file>'. A component with 'status' 'pending' or 'check' stops a release, but not a dry run.",
